rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\">6连百分比＞铃音＞尤娜＞人偶＞木锤＞三星机器人。</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(0,182,79);width:calc(100%-1px);\"><p class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;color:rgb(255,255,255);font-weight:bold;width:auto;\">2.DS设置</p></div><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\">三把刀都很强的情况下：</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\">※不带火莫娜带光豹：1.轮滑妹&nbsp; &nbsp;2.光豹（红4），没有选鲜花或者墨丘利 &nbsp; 3.木双刃<br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">※带火莫娜不<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">带光豹</span>：<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">1.轮滑妹&nbsp; &nbsp;2.火莫娜&nbsp; &nbsp;3.木双刃</span></span><br></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">主力两把刀，第三把刀很弱或者没上情况下：</span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">※不带轮滑妹<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">不带火莫娜</span>带木莫娜：1.对策&nbsp; 2.墨丘利<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;3.木双刃</span></span><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">※不带轮滑妹</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">带火莫娜</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">带木莫娜：<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">1.对策&nbsp; 2.火莫娜</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;3.木双刃</span></span><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">※<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">不带轮滑妹</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">不带火莫娜</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">带木莫娜<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">带光豹</span>：1.光豹 &nbsp;2.墨丘利</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;3.木双刃</span></span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(0,182,79);width:calc(100%-1px);\"><p class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;color:rgb(255,255,255);font-weight:bold;width:auto;\">3.队长设置</p></div><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">※</span>S命中附魔不多时选木人鱼</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">※</span>S命中附魔多（3个以上）时选</span>对策<br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(0,182,79);width:calc(100%-1px);\"><p class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;color:rgb(255,255,255);font-weight:bold;width:auto;\">4.几个位置替换选择</p></div><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\">※罗宾&nbsp;轮滑&nbsp;乳贴&nbsp;光豹&nbsp;明王这几个位置都是可以替换的，具体看你有什么哪个更高加</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\">※如果你选择对策DS，那就下罗宾，反之必上罗宾<br></div></div><div><br></div><div data-col=\"11\" class=\"selectItem mould-table-wrap\" contenteditable=\"false\" model-id=\"74148\" data-insertcount=\"0\" data-select=\"[]\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"table-container\">\n                                  <div class=\"table-overflow\">\n                                    \n                                    \n                                    \n                                    <table class=\"mould-table selectItemTable col-group-table\" style=\"width: 768px;\">\n                                      <colgroup><col style=\"width: 63px;\"><col style=\"width: 71px;\"><col style=\"width: 70px;\"><col style=\"width: 70px;\"><col style=\"width: 69px;\"><col style=\"width: 69px;\"><col style=\"width: 66px;\"><col style=\"width: 68px;\"><col style=\"width: 74px;\"><col style=\"width: 75px;\"><col style=\"width: 73px;\"></colgroup>\n                                      <tbody>\n                                        \n                                      <tr style=\"height: 76px;\"><td class=\"\" contenteditable=\"false\"><div cla